{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"861734060157435914","name":"shop-cures-n-curses💊☠","position":90,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"This shop is run by Seelie fey during the day, where various \"cures\" can be found for sale. At night Unseelie fey run the shop which sign changes to \"curse\" and various curses are available... for anyone desperate enough to make the deal.","type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"861734060157435914","content":"This shop is run by Seelie fey during the day, where various \"cures\" can be found for sale. At night Unseelie fey run the shop whose sign changes to \"curse\" and various curses are available... for anyone desperate enough to make the deal.","created_at":"2021-07-05T22:25:31.789000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-05T22:47:35.718000Z","id":"861734570197778442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"861734060157435914","content":"**\"CURES\" AVAILABLE DAYTIME:**\n**Charm of Counterspell**- 1500g\nThis charm allows you to cast the counterspell spell at level 3 as a reaction. You can use this charm twice, then it vanishes. If You do not have a spellcasting modifier add nothing to your roll.  The charm is on a small bracelet, as a reaction the charm can be squeezed, activating it.\n\n**Great Fairy's Veil**- 1500g\nYou have resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage from nonmagical attacks for the next 12 hours.\n\n**Fae’s Fate**- 500g\nYou can reroll one of your character’s rolls of your choosing within the next 24 hours\n\n**Dispel Magic**- lvl 3=400g, lvl 4=640g, lvl 5=1280g lvl 6=2560g\nChoose one creature, object, or magical effect within range. Any spell of 3rd level or lower on the target ends. For each spell of 4th level or higher on the target, make an ability check using your spellcasting ability. The DC equals 10 + the spell’s level. On a successful check, the spell ends.\nAt Higher Levels: When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, you automatically end the effects of a spell on the target if the spell's level is equal to or less than the level of the spell slot you used.\n\n**Remove Curse**- 500g \nAt your touch, all curses affecting one creature or object end. If the object is a cursed magic item, its curse remains, but the spell breaks its owner’s attunement to the object so it can be removed or discarded.","created_at":"2021-07-05T22:33:35.384000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T08:07:00.673000Z","id":"861736598541697054","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"861734060157435914","content":"**Greater Restoration**- 1300g\nYou imbue a creature you touch with positive energy to undo a debilitating effect. You can reduce the target’s exhaustion level by one, or end one of the following effects on the target:\nOne effect that charmed or petrified the target\nOne curse, including the target’s attunement to a cursed magic item\nAny reduction to one of the target’s ability scores\nOne effect reducing the target’s hit point maximum","created_at":"2021-07-05T22:33:39.298000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-05T22:34:31.473000Z","id":"861736614958596126","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
